b. Acceptance Criteria (When we know it WORKS correctly)
1. User Login
- User enters valid credentials
- System verifies credentials
- User is redirected to dashboard
- Error shown for invalid login
2. Activity Update
- Staff selects child
- Staff inputs activity (meal/sleep/behavior)
- System saves data
- Parents receive notification
3. Photo Upload
- Staff uploads image
- Image is stored in database
- Parents can view image
- Image loads successfully
4. Pickup Notification
- Child is marked as picked up
- System sends notification to parent
- Parent receives alert instantly
5. Safe Word Verification
- Pickup person enters safe word
- System validates safe word
- Access granted if correct
-Access denied if incorrect

